      "id": "GPD-01",
      "chapter": "global",
      "anchor": "global-primitive-projection-glue",
      "title": "The two projected residue modules are the same gluing quotient",
      "hypotheses": "A full integral Hermitian lattice L in a totally definite space V with rational orthogonal decomposition U ⊕ W.",
      "statement": "For the two intersection lattices P,Q, projection identifies L/(P⊕Q) with both pL/P and qL/Q. Their duals are p(L∨) and q(L∨).",
